[5] New evidence was provided by the Applicant to corroborate his allegations of new risk arising after 2015, including:
· Sworn statement from his nephew;
· Letters from his wife, neighbour and two daughters in Turkey;
· A complaint written by his wife to Turkish authorities;
· Letters from Kurdish and Alevi community members and organizations in Canada;
· Photographs of his political participation and activities in Canada; and
· Updated country condition documents.

